# Optional Cursor surfaces

- **Canvas**: only for standalone audits (`/canvas-audit`) — not for routine UI code
- **Automations**: only if user asks (`/automations`) — Agents Window finish path
- **Loop**: session QA (`/loop-qa`) — no background shell loops (Shell denied)
- **Cloud / background agents**: only if user asks (`/cloud-agent`)
- **Notepads**: `.cursor/notepads/` via `/notepad`
- **Autopilot / Split PRs / Bugbot / Security**: `/autopilot-pr` `/split-prs` `/bugbot` `/security-review`
- **Memories**: `/memory` — personal; never store API keys
